# Every blow of a fight reaches the journal: who struck whom, with what, and what it left.
#
# A fight has a log, but it is the board's — dice, Cinetic Points, "HIT!" — and nothing of it reached
# the journal but the fight's milestone. FightModeAdapter now records each attack as an event, hit or
# miss, a fall and an escape, naming the enemy as the player knows it ("the wolf"), never by the
# generated name on the board. The same blows as fight_victory_companion.cli.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --grant-mm pugilitas:5,brawling:5 --start-fight wolf --no-chronicler

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode Fighting 90

strategy succeed

click skill "Lacerate"
click skill "Knee Strike"
wait 25
click fighter Redhorn
wait 25
click continue
wait 25

inspect journal
expect-state journal kind=Event
expect-state journal the wolf
expect-no-state journal Redhorn

quit
